<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<CustomField xmlns="http://soap.sforce.com/2006/04/metadata">
    <!--
        THIS COMMENT SITS INSIDE THE ROOT ELEMENT DELIBERATELY. A comment placed ABOVE
        <CustomField> breaks `sf` deploy at source conversion with a misleading "unable to find
        matching parent xml file" error.

        DISPOSITION GAP CLOSURE TRANCHE 1, ITEM 1 (agent-output/disposition-gap-closure-t1-design.md
        §3 Item 1). Pairs with Principal_Approved__c - see that field's XML comment for the full
        "two representations of one approval" reasoning (Status__c = 'Approved' is the lifecycle
        position; this pair is the machine-written audit fact). Not designed with a writer in this
        tranche - Tranche 3's approval action is expected to stamp both fields together.

        =====================================================================================
        🔴 SHIPPED AS Date, AS REQUESTED - BUT RAISED, NOT DECIDED, HERE FOR TRANCHE 3.
        =====================================================================================
        ARCHITECTURE.md §1 forbids a `Date` suffix on a DateTime field, and a Date-only field is
        correctly suffixed `Date` on that rule alone. But every OTHER approval fact already
        recorded in this module is captured with a full timestamp (see ApprovalAuditService's
        callers elsewhere in the app). If Tranche 3's final approval action stamps NOW() rather
        than TODAY(), this field is the wrong type and must become a DateTime named
        Principal_Approved_DateTime__c instead - additively, per the same delete+create
        constraint that governs every other field-shape change in this codebase (Salesforce has
        no in-place type change from Date to DateTime). Confirm the required precision before
        Tranche 3 wires a writer to this field.

        FLS: same posture as Principal_Approved__c - read in DPEG_Disposition_View, read-only
        (editable=false) in DPEG_Disposition_Edit. Applied in the consolidated permission-set
        pass, not this file.

        Risk: LOW. No reader, no writer in T1.
    -->
    <fullName>Principal_Approved_Date__c</fullName>
    <description>Date a principal approved this NDA for release. Machine-written audit fact, paired with Principal_Approved__c. Type raised for Tranche 3 confirmation - see the XML comment in this file.</description>
    <inlineHelpText>Set by the approval process when a principal approves this NDA for release.</inlineHelpText>
    <label>Principal Approved Date</label>
    <required>false</required>
    <trackHistory>false</trackHistory>
    <trackTrending>false</trackTrending>
    <type>Date</type>
</CustomField>
